<h3><i class="fa fa-note-sticky"></i> Î£Î·Î¼ÎµÎ¹ÏŽÏƒÎµÎ¹Ï‚</h3>
<div class="notes-section">
<form class="notes-form" id="notesForm">
<input class="form-control" id="noteInput" placeholder="Î“ÏÎ¬ÏˆÏ„Îµ Ï„Î· ÏƒÎ·Î¼ÎµÎ¯Ï‰ÏƒÎ® ÏƒÎ±Ï‚..." style="max-width:180px;" type="text"/>
